Mitsubishi Electric CN105 (mitsubishi/cn105/)
---------------------------------------------
Protocol knowledge (frame layout, byte positions, constants and temperature
encodings) is based on the reverse-engineering work of the projects below.
The script is an independent implementation for the Shelly scripting engine
(Espruino) and does not contain code from those projects.

  * SwiCago/HeatPump - original reverse engineering of the CN105 protocol
    https://github.com/SwiCago/HeatPump
    Repository license GPL-3.0; source file headers LGPL-2.1-or-later.

  * echavet/MitsubishiCN105ESPHome - ESPHome implementation of the protocol
    https://github.com/echavet/MitsubishiCN105ESPHome
    No license file in the repository.
